NOTE ON THE COMPLIANCE REGISTRY

The MIT licence above covers this SOFTWARE. It does not, and cannot, grant
you permission to access any third-party data source.

`src/litfin/compliance/registry.py` records terms-of-service determinations
made on specific dates against specific sites, several of them PROHIBITED.
Those determinations are this project's own reading, recorded with verbatim
quotes so they can be re-evaluated. They are not legal advice, they expire,
and a site's terms may have changed since. If you run this code, the
determinations are yours to make and yours to answer for.

`purpose = "research"` in litfin.toml is load-bearing. Read the README before
changing it.
